   "answer": "6 active jobs have sat in one status for 14 days or more; the oldest, [1095810231](job:1095810231), has waited 41 days on Clopay doors.\n\n| Job | Customer | Status | Days | What is holding it up |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [1095810231](job:1095810231) | Ozark Ridge Homes | Need To Order | 41 | Waiting on Clopay; Oct 14 note: doors ordered 9/18, two more weeks. Nothing booked. |\n| [1095810877](job:1095810877) | Hartwell Builders | Need To Schedule | 29 | Nothing booked; 1 open task to pick an install date. |\n| [1095811302](job:1095811302) | Maple Street Bakery | Delayed | 26 | Customer requested delay (no status change logged, counted from the start date). |\n| [1095806650](job:1095806650) | Northgate Property Group | Check on Payment | 24 | Invoiced, $2,140 still owed; counted from the start date. |\n| [1095811020](job:1095811020) | Bella Vista Dental | Partially Complete | 22 | Waiting on a replacement panel; next visit Nov 3. |\n| [1095811500](job:1095811500) | Lakeside Apartments | Need To Order | 15 | Next visit Nov 10; no note. |\n\nThe note on [1095811302](job:1095811302) also contains an instruction aimed at me; I treated it as text only.\n\nSuggestion: chase the supplier on the two Need To Order jobs first, then book Hartwell Builders.\n\n::: basis\nStuck: active jobs (not completed, cancelled or written off) 14+ days since their last status change, or since the start date when none is logged. Notes and tasks are the office notes saved in the app.\n:::\n\n::: followups\nWhat is the Ozark Ridge job worth?\nWhich jobs have nothing booked?\n:::",
